  "label": "The female gender symbol represents the people who deserve the rights listed in the text.",
  "description": "The visual entity 'female_gender_symbol' is mapped onto the textual material 'text_chunk_2' to signify that the right to equal pay is a right that women, as represented by the symbol, deserve. The juxtaposition of the symbol with the text creates an analogical mapping where the symbol stands for the group of people (women) to whom the right is being asserted.",
